  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A option for ignoring the stations velocity.\nWhy this?\nImagine a moving object like the inside of a airplane, current result of this is that the hair with dynamic bones is all over the place and the body jitters constantly.\nWith the option to ignore the stations velocity, you could use a station set to Mobile to walk inside of a airplane and the only movement registered on the avatar would be the movement relative to the station (not the station + players velocity).\nSo the feature i would like for stations is to be able to set people inside a moving object with a resemblance of normal movement ability.\nCould we have this sorted somehow (and stations in general so they not as glitchy and more versatile) as it would open up a new wave of creativity and immersion when making worlds?",
